<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits burned an entire village in Niger, killing three civilians, while an armed group killed 13 soldiers in southwestern Niger in an attack claimed by Islamic State. Militants also killed at least 30 civilians in a reprisal attack in Niger State, Nigeria, and abducted a Saudi national. Insurgents are now employing off-the-shelf drones in their attacks. The conflict caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nigerian Voice&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxPM1RoZnRWMHVhalB6ZmVNdzZwcUZUcVYxWXJzRkNPejhDa181RlNBZDBwcFlMOHZSQXB1bWcxX2o0Qy11UDlPcGsxNzJ2c0labEVjNGoyU0tRVlZWTGZnNS0zaXp2Y2ZnQ1VhUmtYN0JuMHg4UjdBbk9OQUpoVDJCSlQyRzZHa1NHUHZwbDcwdEo3eW5BTFBFUkZDbmdNZ3JNeFBiWkNrdnFkTjl0eDF2dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Magzter&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxQMjJ3V2hNVEI5MWpxQ2RSZkZHZkpONTJyZEotazQwZHpjcExGa3NEN0ZsenBKYzF6SU54ZDRMcFg5SWNRZTk1X2VOanVoaWxQeWNqUndZaTliVUlUUW44czhpbDY0aF9STy1WeWpVMEdRS3p5NWVaSGRMTFFiaGxEcHJjOHh5Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mining.com.au&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNdlczOXd0YnNLNGduUU5mYWd2U0pXeGI5djRWaEwwVDdvWkV1Y29CX3ZqX002US1HbWVMWkltU2MyeXJtYlNvR3BPMGc2blRWMk42djE2bGxjcVkwU2Y2NXE1MzdJWWt1WGlTN2stOGlZTzZJOTlJTlVBOU1LRmpRUmU3cTI1WWRDX3FNMkJjWW95WDg3dU9CYg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxQalRVSlU1YTNnemtNa3lxUXFWSzBvd1BwUFg2T2dVOXlPVWl6SU55bWpRQmJiUW0zajRveXhwS1ZWQXVWTFlWazdpVkMzRkRkV3p6bk1GVUNRbGJWaUpkZ0JjSFhhanVldmtRbkJfS3Bzb1g2WHlFZ0ItQ1AycEtrMTdQRDRkUjQ4X1g2QVltWDBRdi1oOWkzMkRtcDNxUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;LEADERSHIP Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxQOW02QkhOc0JaNlIwNC04Wmt